        "detailed_description": "<br><br><i>FROM THE GROUND is a third-person multiplayer PVP shooter set in a cartoon world where fruits and vegetables have taken over the world. In this game, you play as one of 12 characters, also called &quot;Juicers,&quot; along with other players in a variety of game modes. </i><br><br><strong>Varied Environments</strong><br><br>Fruits and vegetables are not just simple foods you harvest from a field, but living beings that now dominate the world. These quirky beings call themselves &quot;Juicers,&quot; and they have only one thing in mind: fighting each other. <br>They clash in varied environments; farmlands, military bases, and undergrounds are part of their playground. Nothing can stops them. <br>Once they choose an area, the juice starts flowing !<br><br><strong>Fruit Salad</strong><br><br>Face off against other players in a free-for-all game mode where each elimination earns you a point.<br>The winner of the game is the player who reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.<br><br><strong>Team Death Match</strong><br><br>Face off against other players with your team until you have eliminated them all.<br>The winner of the game is the team that reaches the maximum score limit or who has the highest score at the end of the allotted time.",
